  m_text: "\u25CF You're Ready\nThat's the basics \u2014 Left Click, Right Click,
    \n[X] and [E] are all you need. Open the shop \nand start taking orders. A new
    ingredient\n unlocks each day: lettuce, onion, beer and \nwine. At 21:00 you
    can press the cube behind \nyou to start the next day. There are 5 days in\n
    total. Press [T] at any time to close the tutorial."
